Track 1: Latitude of the Last Bridge
- Story & Context: When Elias found the submerged street sign for the old market, he felt the city shiver beneath his boots; he realized the tide had swallowed the history he was trying to map. A sudden current surge knocked him backward, soaking his kit in oily brine, yet he kept playing the rhythm as the water reached his knees. "The map is just a ghost now, dragging anchors across the floor."
